 leading a college that\nRead More →\nAbout us\nMankachar College was established in 1971. with .A Stream alone. The organizing meeting of the college was held on the 8th day of March,·1970  in the J.M.H.S. School premises ·with Late Zahirul Islam, the then MLA of Mankachar LA Constituency in the chair. ..He was the President of the ooffo·Qrganizing Governing Body of the college and Sri Shankarlal Agarwala, M.Com ,LLB.. was the    Secretary of the college till 1981. The.. college came  under Deficit .Grants-in-Aid system on 1st September,1981.The general people of the locality contribute generously for the development of the college.. So, the college nomenclature “Mankachar 'College” .The college is affiliated to Gauhati University and registered under Section 2(f).it and registered undr SeCtion 2(f) & 12(B) of the UGC Act 1956.\nKnow More →\nNews & Updates\nRound 2 Merit List_BA_2026\nPosted on 2026-06-09\nRound 2 Merit List_BSc_2026\nPosted on 2026-06-09\n1st Merit list 2026-27_Arts\nPosted on 2026-06-02\n1st Merit list 2026-27_Science\nPosted on 2026-06-02\nShort-list for Principal Interview\nPosted on 2025-11-15\nNews Archieve →\nTenders\nQuotation\nPosted on 2026-07-25\nNotice Inviting Quotation\nPosted on 2026-04-28\nQuotation/Tender Notice\nPosted on 2024-09-14\nNotice Inviting Quotation for Library Books\nPosted on 2024-08-31\nTender Archieve →\nEvents\nComputer Courses (2024-08-22)\nEvent Archieve →\nOur faculty members\nDharmo Nath Das\nEmail :\ndharmonathdas@mankacharcollege.in\nprofile\nDr. Abdul Motleb Shaikh\nEmail :\nabdulmotlebshaikh@mankacharcollege.in\nprofile\nDr. Abdul Mozid Sheikh\nEmail :\nabdulmozidsheikh@mankacharcollege.in\nprofile\nDr. Akila Shemim\nEmail :\nakilashemim@mankacharcollege.in\nprofile\nDr. Firdusa Begum\nEmail :\nfirdusabegum@mankacharcollege.in\nprofile\nDr. Lutumoni Begam\nEmail :\nlutumonibegam@mankacharcollege.in\nprofile\nDr. Morsheduz Zaman\nEmail :\nmorsheduzzaman@gmail.com\nprofile\nDr. Santosh Kumar Singh\nEmail :\nsa